                    {
                        "sense_id": "ecc74a3e-ed93-3903-baf7-8633248a590e",
                        "entry_id": "71176aea-54a7-3d0b-a32f-072603b16273",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Middlebrow attitudes generally; the quality of being middlebrow."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0bcab6b0-da72-4dfb-a97b-53683f92fd90",
                                "sense_id": "ecc74a3e-ed93-3903-baf7-8633248a590e",
                                "text": "If we wish to stop this march of middlebrowism, education must revamp both its philosophy and its objectives."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54465fea-512b-4e69-89d6-c129b788cd50",
                                "sense_id": "ecc74a3e-ed93-3903-baf7-8633248a590e",
                                "text": "In fact, there were critics who saw middlebrowism itself as one of the aesthetic faces of Stalinism."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0d9b2f1-ffe5-4f32-9cbd-0d08ffb26089",
                                "sense_id": "ecc74a3e-ed93-3903-baf7-8633248a590e",
                                "text": "As Joan Rubin observes in The Making of Middlebrow Culture, the critical backlash against middlebrowism emerged as an eleventh-hour barrier against the erosion of highbrow authority."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
